<title>USA: Suiza Foods names COO Bill Brick president.</title>
<headline>Suiza Foods names COO Bill Brick president.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suiza Foods Corp said Thursday it named Bill Brick president in addition to his job as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Brick replaces Cletes &quot;Tex&quot; Beshears, who was named vice chairman of the board.</p>
<p>The new positions will be effective July 1.</p>
<p>Suiza Foods is a Dallas based company with principal holdings in the dairy processing and packaged ice industries.</p>
